          "urgency": "Expected",
          "description": "* WHAT...An increased risk for sneaker waves and strong rip\ncurrents with breaking waves of 12 to 16 ft expected.\n\n* WHERE...Pacific Coast beaches.\n\n* WHEN...From 5 AM Thursday to 7 PM PST Saturday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Waves can sweep across the shoreline without warning,\npulling people into the sea from beaches, jetties, and rocks.",
